                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce05f538-fcfd-4c8c-848d-c8e185727031",
                                                "sense_id": "a7c556a8-2fb7-3bdf-bf4e-e100fc2b520e",
                                                "text": "Reuniting the cast of Trainspotting for a new adventure 21 years on could have gone badly. The BBC's misjudged This Life + 10, bringing the cast of the iconic 90s TV drama back together, is a case in point. But [Danny] Boyle and his four musketeers give it just the right frantic, jaded energy and manic anxiety."
